:"history-p012-b0013","text":"先后开凿了济州河、会通河、通惠河等新河道，使运河不再绕道洛阳","bbox":[558.151,357.136,405.522,13.517],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0034"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0014","text":"【知识延伸】","bbox":[387.775,636.778,81.104,13.517],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0035"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0015","text":"都江堰","bbox":[408.051,657.054,40.552,13.517],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0036"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0016","text":"1.三大主体工程","bbox":[500.983,559.127,88.649,18.511],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0037","history-p012-n0038"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0017","text":"鱼嘴分水堤","bbox":[621.795,445.844,67.587,13.517],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0039"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0018","text":"形如鱼头的堤坝将岷江一分为二，形成内江和外江","bbox":[721.486,395.999,297.383,13.517],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0040"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0019","text":"它利用地形和水势，实现了“四六分水”的动态平衡","bbox":[721.486,411.215,295.39,18.577],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0041","history-p012-n0042","history-p012-n0043","history-p012-n0044","history-p012-n0045"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0020","text":"枯水期，约六成江水流入内江，保证灌溉洪水期，约六成江水排入外江，实现泄洪","bbox":[721.486,455.137,243.313,33.793],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0046","history-p012-n0047"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0021","text":"飞沙堰溢洪道","bbox":[621.795,564.121,81.104,13.517],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0048"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0022","text":"作为内江的“安全阀”，当水量过大时，多余","bbox":[735.004,509.282,252.672,18.511],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0049","history-p012-n0050","history-p012-n0051","history-p012-n0052","history-p012-n0053"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0023","text":"的水会漫过这道低矮的堰坝，排入外江","bbox":[735.004,534.552,229.796,13.517],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0054"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0024","text":"利用水流在弯道产生的离心力，形成漩涡，能将内江","bbox":[735.004,573.415,310.9,13.517],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0055"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0025","text":"80%以上的泥沙和卵石“甩”出，有效防止了渠道淤积","bbox":[735.004,588.696,306.564,18.512],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0056","history-p012-n0057","history-p012-n0058","history-p012-n0059","history-p012-n0060","history-p012-n0061"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0026","text":"宝瓶口引水口","bbox":[621.795,672.261,81.104,13.517],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0062"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0027","text":"人工在玉垒山凿开的一个形似瓶口的狭","bbox":[735.004,632.553,229.796,13.517],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0063"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0028","text":"窄通道，是内江水进入成都平原的咽喉","bbox":[735.004,652.829,229.796,13.517],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0064"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0029","text":"像一道天然闸门，精确控制进入灌区的水量，确保平原地区用水平稳","bbox":[735.004,691.692,405.522,13.517],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0065"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0030","text":"2.历史地位","bbox":[500.983,744.991,64.004,18.512],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0066","history-p012-n0067"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0031","text":"是世界现存年代最久、唯一留存、仍在使用的无坝引水利工程","bbox":[597.295,730.555,378.487,13.517],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0068","history-p012-n0069","history-p012-n0070","history-p012-n0071","history-p012-n0072","history-p012-n0073"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0032","text":"2000年列入世界文化遗产，2018年列入世界灌溉工程遗产名录","bbox":[597.295,764.423,372.487,18.511],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0074","history-p012-n0075","history-p012-n0076","history-p012-n0077"]},{"id":"history-p012-b0033","text":"12","bbox":[587.275,810.711,16.0,21.344],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0078"]}],"questions":[{"id":"history-p012-q001","number":1,"type":"fill-in","answer":"芍陂","bbox":[652.773,52.15,27.035,13.517],"fontSize":13.517,"color":"#15831c","segments":[{"text":"芍陂","bbox":[652.773,52.15,27.035,13.517],"color":"#15831c"}],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0008"],"aliases":[],"context":"①春秋时期楚相孙叔敖修建____，又名安丰塘，是中国最早的蓄水灌溉工程"},{"id":"history-p012-q002","number":2,"type":"fill-in","answer":"李冰","bbox":[585.186,95.236,27.035,13.517],"fontSize":13.517,"color":"#15831c","segments":[{"text":"李冰","bbox":[585.186,95.236,27.035,13.517],"color":"#15831c"}],"nodeIds":["history-p012-n0012"],"aliases":[],"context":"②战国时期秦国____主持修建的____、韩国水工郑国修建的____"},{"id":"history-p012-q003","number":3,"type":"fill-in","answer":"都江堰","bbox":[679.808,95.236,40.552,13.517],"fontSize":13.517,"color":"#15831c","segments":[{"text":"都江堰","bb